Package: placematchr
Title: Normalize and Match City Names to NUTS Regions
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-02-01
Authors@R: person("Giulian", "Etingin-Frati", email = "etingin-frati@kof.ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Normalizes city names for Germany (DE) and Switzerland (CH) and matches them to NUTS 3 regions using provided crosswalks. Features include comprehensive normalization rules, cascading matching logic (Exact NUTS -> Exact LAU -> Fuzzy), and single-source data synthesis.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
